way down.

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:09.540
Yeah. Well, I mean I think that there may
be a relatively small sample size anyway to

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:13.470
compare to compare it to in a country with
a far smaller population, but I think that

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:17.670
I look forward to seeing the full data on
that. I think you're starting to get to, I

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:21.269
mean, yeah, for me access to guns is absolutely
a part of this, but there's something else

00:09:21.269 --> 00:09:25.889
which is actually a much more cultural thing
