00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:06.649
I think that's a really astute observation.
And I think that the, so the, where I kind

00:10:06.649 --> 00:10:11.569
of go from that is where do people get that
idea? Right? So you're saying that people

00:10:11.569 --> 00:10:16.999
are fundamentally viewing firearms as solutions
to problems. And I think what's more dangerous

00:10:16.999 --> 00:10:23.459
than video games, far more dangerous is actually
these sort of echo chamber toxic communities

00:10:23.459 --> 00:10:27.431
on the Internet. Which like the more I've
done stuff with healthy Gamer, the more I

00:10:27.431 --> 00:10:33.079
sort of get people who are looking for help.
And, and the more I sort of sort of see this

00:10:33.079 --> 00:10:37.910
side of the Internet and you can look at some
