know, Walmart or school, and then they're

00:11:15.389 --> 00:11:20.490
actually like allotted within these communities.
They're there, they're viewed as like heroes.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:26.300
And so I think that kind of that kind of like
psychological indoctrination, which is going

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:30.279
on through through some of these toxic internet
communities is like really dangerous.

00:11:30.279 --> 00:11:35.589
So could there be sort of like a third factor
correlation where you have maybe the shootings,

00:11:35.589 --> 00:11:40.819
there may be a correlation with the, the,
the sort of antisocial self perpetuating echo

00:11:40.819 --> 00:11:45.740
chambers of hate that exists online. And it
just so happens that many of the people in

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:51.279
those communities happen to also be playing
video games because of their sort of societal

00:11:51.279 --> 00:11:56.850
or, or, um, social situation. But that is
not a causal connection. Is that a possibility?

00:11:56.850 --> 00:12:01.410
Absolutely. So, so what you're talking about
is essentially something called a confounding

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:08.309
variable, which is something that's related
to the, the route and the outcome, but as

00:12:08.309 --> 00:12:13.269
actually like somewhat separate. So I think
that the, the gaming community and some of

00:12:13.269 --> 00:12:18.319
these toxic internet communities have a heavy
