00:13:48.809 --> 00:13:52.230
yeah. So David, I think there's a subtle

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:55.350
problem in the way that you're framing your
question and you're presuming that because

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:58.279
you're accepting the premise that mental health
